        "text_908007915_copy_": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-fe8967f731@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-9846ac1203@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 10 2020 13:09:36 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h1><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Lightening the Load: Unpacking Cognitive Overload</span></span></span></span></span></span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><br>\nToday, roughly 80% of medical-device user errors occur due to cognitive overload. In addition, persistent cognitive overload contributes to fatigue, burnout, and practice dissatisfaction among nurses and other clinical team members. Hospital systems and clinical leaders are challenged with creating environments and systems to help lift some of the burden placed on healthcare professionals. In this course, we'll discuss system wide solutions to address these challenges, and in particular, how technology can play a pivotal role in lightening the load, and the positive impacts these changes have on nursing wellbeing, and patient care.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><br>\n<b>Course Objectives:</b></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The three different types of cognitive load</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"> The factors that contribute to cognitive overload</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"> How a heavy cognitive load impacts nurses and patients</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"> Solutions to address cognitive overload</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">How technology can help lighten the load</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri May 24 2024 14:19:16 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
